      "message": "Why it doesn\u0027t make sense on top of the current 126911:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \n1. It\u0027s redundant. Patch set a1f90e4 already fixes the same problem with build-helper and already has embedSourcesInClassOutputs\u003dfalse.\n                                                                                                                                                                                   \n2. It conflicts. A trial rebase in a throwaway worktree conflicts on the embedSourcesInClassOutputs lines, because both commits add them.    \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n3. Adding \u003cresources\u003e override, on top of build-helper. src/main/proto would then be registered twice.\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \n4. The approach is the more fragile one. Overriding \u003cresources\u003e drops the resource entries inherited from the ODL parent (target/generated-sources/spi and .../yang). That causes no harm in gnmi-proto today, because those directories aren\u0027t generated there. But it silently disconnects the module from parent resource config. build-helper only adds to the list.",
